                        "review": "How this received such low ratings WILL ALWAYS AMAZE me.  Honestly, I own 2 copies of the ONLY other game like this produced by a company that rhyms with PairOfSocks.  Half the DLC as well. No matter what I do can NEVER seem to get into it.  This game here?  Perfect UI (10/10 Dark Perfection), 9/10 Automation for GOOD micro-management mitigation.  9/10 tutorial (only better would of been voiced) 10/10 ONE DLC instead of TWO DOZEN.  Just played ONE game of this on tutorial/easy, beat it on the largest galaxy, and INSTA BOUGHT that DLC :)\n\nYes if you are into strategy GEMS, and just want something that doesn't take a freaken COURSE STUDY in how it operates, this can be something that is right up your alley in the best way!  \n\nI went in expecting a buggy mess to some extent, after all Black Suns IS super hard to get to run IMO (although like this A HIDDEN GEM if you can), yet this thing was SMOOTH AS BUTTER in 4K.  PURE RECOMMEND!",
